      "cooked": "<p>Punishment(I): Whenever you Attack an enemy that has inflicted a penalty on you, treat that penalty as if it were a bonus for the purpose of that Attack.</p>\n<p>Something For Everyone:&nbsp;Attack using [power]. Use your Mid die to Attack one extra target for each bonus you have. Apply a different bonus to each Attack.<br>\n<br>\nQuestion: If I have no bonuses, but several targets have put penalties on me. Would Punishment enable me to Attack those targets using Something For Everyone?</p>",
